    "note": "Everything goes out by 8:00 on collection day, national holidays included. There is no collection Dec 31 – Jan 3. Bottles, cans and PET go to a separate bottle/can/PET point where the crates and net are set out the afternoon before. Paper and clothes go to your neighbourhood group's collection point (usually marked with an orange flag). Clothes aren't collected on rainy days.",
